    "text": "<p>In a triangle <math><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></math> , let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></math> .</p><p>If <math><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8722;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8722;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>, then the value of <math><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math> is _______</p>",
